2.5px] text-[var(--text)]">內部人動向</span><span class="shrink-0 font-num text-[13px] tabular-nums" style="color: var(--chart-1);">70</span></div><div class="h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[var(--surface-2)]"><div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width: 70%; background-color: var(--chart-1);"></div></div><p class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-[1.5]">內部人淨交易金額（Form 4 申報，買超為正）</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] text-[var(--text)]">分析師預估修正</span><span class="shrink-0 font-num text-[13px] tabular-nums" style="color: var(--chart-2);">40</span></div><div class="h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[var(--surface-2)]"><div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width: 40%; background-color: var(--chart-2);"></div></div><p class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-[1.5]">EPS預估趨勢變化與分析師上下修家數之綜合指標</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] text-[var(--text)]">產業動能</span><span class="shrink-0 font-num text-[13px] tabular-nums" style="color: var(--chart-2);">30</span></div><div class="h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[var(--surface-2)]"><div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width: 30%; background-color: var(--chart-2);"></div></div><p class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-[1.5]">所屬產業3個月平均報酬於當日全產業排名</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><span class="text-[12.5px] text-[var(--text)]">大盤連動</span><span class="shrink-0 font-num text-[13px] tabular-nums" style="color: var(--chart-2);">20</span></div><div class="h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[var(--surface-2)]"><div class="h-full rounded-full" style="width: 20%; background-color: var(--chart-2);"></div></div><p class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-[1.5]">與大盤(TAIEX)日報酬相關性</p></div></div></div>"`;

